message: "Please cite the specific repository release or associated publication used in your work. Until a release DOI is available, cite this active research repository and include the accessed commit or version."
title: "Quantum–Spacetime Bridge"
abstract: >-
  An independent exploratory computational-physics research repository
  investigating finite relational and graph-based models, including coupled
  matter and edge-field dynamics. The repository also develops a
  provenance-controlled PostgreSQL research data warehouse, metadata-governed
  Data Marts, and multidimensional scientific analytics. It preserves source
  lineage, validation outcomes, controls, rejected candidates, repair states,
  and claim boundaries. Current results are model-internal and do not
  constitute a validated physical theory of spacetime or gravitation.
type: software
